This directory contains a modified version of UV Studio (from
armel/armel.github.io, uvstudio/, commit 2ca63bcf, 2026-09-09), adapted by
the RxJa project (https://github.com/dosei/uvk1-japanese). Changes: rebranded
as RxJa Tools; Japanese UI added (and made the default); other locales and
the flash counter removed; RxJa releases added to the firmware catalog;
automatic upload of the Japanese data (ja_res.bin) after flashing RxJa; and a
page for writing the Japanese data.
